# (3) and Mox Ruby (not an instant or sorcery) are refused. Both mana sources were spent on Founding, so Opt really cost nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Island
Founding the Third Path
Opt
Quick Study
Mox Ruby
Island
